    "title": "Northville's 250-goal, college-bound star voted Michigan's top senior lacrosse player - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matthew Ehler ,\n12 hours ago Addison Gubing has been impossible to ignore — a 250-plus goal scorer who’s powered Northville all season. Now she has the title to match. Fans named Gubing the top high school senior lacrosse player in Michigan, as the college-bound standout received 38,002 votes to earn the award over Brighton’s Abby Kissel, who finished runner-up with 24,295 votes. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
